<title>USA: IMM currency futures close mixed in light trade.</title>
<headline>IMM currency futures close mixed in light trade.</headline>
<text>
<p>March 19 - IMM currency futures closed mixed in light trade. Marks, Swiss francs were lower in rangebound trade, while sterling remained buoyed on signs of a strong U.K. labor sector. June pesos forfeited most of the day's gains. June Can dollars look weak after slipping through $0.7300, traders said.</p>
<p>((DerivativesDesk(312)408-8750/E-mail:derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
